                       { via: appImage  when: "arch or void or fedora or (rhel >= 10) or opensuse_tumbleweed or (opensuse_leap >= 16) or (ubuntu >= 22.04) or (debian >= 12) or (elementary >= 7) or (linuxmint >= 21) or (lmde >= 6) or (mx >= 23) or (zorin >= 17) or pikaos or kali"  name: SoundCraft  scope: user  desktop-id: ai.storyteller.soundcraft
